  "bodyHash": "PzpZMqa0Gug=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">功能介绍</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组允许玩家\"标记\"生物实体，使其发光显示。同时会喊出\"发现XXX\"来提醒其他玩家。</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">效果展示</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">玩家标记末影龙的效果：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/822/138/demo1_cf.gif\" alt=\"玩家标记末影龙\" width=\"920\" height=\"480\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Spotting#configuration\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:24px\">配置选项</span></span></h2><h3><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Spotting#common\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:18px\">通用设置</span></span></h3><h4><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Spotting#defaulttracingrange\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认追踪范围</span></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">标记功能的默认有效距离</span></p><h4><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Spotting#defaultspottingcooldown\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认冷却时间</span></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">标记功能的默认冷却时间(刻)，仅在成功标记后生效</span></p><h4><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Spotting#defaultglowingtime\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">默认发光时长</span></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">被标记生物默认的发光持续时间(刻)</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">鸣谢</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/MUYU_Twilighter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MUYU_Twilighter</a>&nbsp;协助研究战地1的相关机制</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faws.amazon.com%252fpolly%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amazon Polly</a>&nbsp;提供TTS服务用于生成语音提示</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.freepik.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FreePik</a> 设计模组图标</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">注意事项</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">本模组需要依赖 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vocalized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vocalized</a> 模组</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>允许</strong></span>将本模组加入您的整合包</span></p>",
